{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "paper-x-posting-requirements",
		"name": "Paper X - Post Requirements (All Roles)",
		"description": "Complete Postman collection for posting requirements from all roles\n\n## Features:\n- Authentication (OTP-based)\n- Brand: Post Packaging/Printing Requirements (Legacy)\n- Brand/Converter: Post Material Requirements (New Unified System)\n- Dealer: Post Buy/Sell Requirements\n- Machine Dealer: Post Machines\n- Reference Data APIs\n\n## Setup:\n1. Set `base_url` variable (e.g., http://localhost:8000)\n2. Run Authentication requests first to get token\n3. Token is automatically saved to `auth_token` variable\n\n## Roles:\n- **Brand**: Post packaging/printing requirements\n- **Converter**: Post material/machine/job requirements\n- **Dealer**: Post material buy/sell requirements\n- **Machine Dealer**: Post machine buy/sell listings",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "paper-x-posting"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Authentication",
			"description": "OTP-based authentication for all roles",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Request OTP",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    console.log('OTP requested successfully');",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('mobile', pm.request.body.raw ? JSON.parse(pm.request.body.raw).mobile : '9876543210');",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"mobile\": \"9876543210\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/otp/request",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "otp", "request"]
						},
						"description": "Request OTP for mobile number. OTP will be sent to the provided mobile number."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Verify OTP & Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.token) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('auth_token', jsonData.data.token);",
									"        pm.environment.set('auth_token', jsonData.data.token);",
									"        console.log('✅ Token saved:', jsonData.data.token.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
									"        ",
									"        // Save user info",
									"        if (jsonData.data.user) {",
									"            pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', jsonData.data.user.id);",
									"            pm.collectionVariables.set('primary_role', jsonData.data.user.primary_role || '');",
									"        }",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"mobile\": \"{{mobile}}\",\n    \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "otp", "verify"]
						},
						"description": "Verify OTP and get authentication token. Token is automatically saved to `auth_token` variable."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
